That the Board take the following action concerning the Petition to Vacate the easterly 6-feet of the 12-foot Wide Alleyway Located in Block 53 of Beach Haven Subdivision, as petitioned by Martha Zlokovich and Neil Zlokovich:
A. Approve or deny the Petition to Vacate the easterly 6-feet of the 12-foot Wide Alleyway Located in Block 53 of Beach Haven Subdivision;
B. Accept the Hold Harmless Agreement;
C. Adopt the Resolution to Vacate; and
D. Authorize the Chair to accept the documents on the day of delivery of the documents to the Chair, and authorize the Chair to sign them at that time.
The real property mentioned in this Petition to Vacate is located in Commission District 2.

That the Board take the following action concerning the Petition to Vacate the 2-foot screening and non-access easement of Lot 9 Block G of Ridgefield Subdivision:
A. Approve or deny the Petition to vacate the 2-foot screening and non-access easement of Lot 9 Block G of Ridgefield Subdivision;
B. Accept the Hold Harmless Agreement;
C. Adopt the Resolution to Vacate; and
D. Authorize the Chair to accept the documents on the day of delivery of the documents to the Chair, and authorize the Chair to sign them at that time.
The real property mentioned in this Petition to Vacate is located in Commission District 4.

That the Board take the following action concerning the Petition to Vacate the 60-foot wide unimproved Turnbuckle Trail right-of-way:
A. Approve or deny the Petition to vacate the 60-foot wide unimproved Turnbuckle Trail right-of-way;
B. Accept the Hold Harmless Agreement;
C. Adopt the Resolution to Vacate; and
D. Authorize the Chair to accept the documents on the day of delivery of the documents to the Chair, and authorize the Chair to sign them at that time.
The real property mentioned in this Petition to Vacate is located in Commission District 2.

