That the Board take the following action concerning Minutes and Reports prepared by the Clerk to the Board's Office:
A. Accept, for filing with the Board's Minutes, the Report of the Gary Sansing Public Forum held September 24, 2026;
B. Approve the Minutes of the Regular BCC Meeting held September 24, 2026;
C. Accept, for filing with the Board's Minutes, the Report of the Gary Sansing Public Forum held October 1, 2026; and
