That the Board adopt and authorize the Chair to sign the Ordinance creating the Libra Lane Roadway Improvements Municipal Services Benefit Unit (MSBU), and all related documents, and make the following findings of fact:
A. Lots in the District are especially benefited since roadway improvements increase the market value of an individual lot, provide individual lot owners with an appropriate and adequate transportation route in the area, and increase the ability of owners to develop their land;
B. The non-ad valorem special assessments levied represent a fair and reasonable apportionment of the cost of the special benefit received by each lot and do not represent a fair share of the cost of general governmental service provided to residents in the unincorporated areas of Escambia County;
C.

