That the Board take the following action concerning the Certificate of Need and Non-Exclusive Long Term Franchise Agreement for Alliant Waste Services, Inc.:
A. Approve the Application for Certificate of Need and Solid Waste Permit, permitting Alliant Waste Services, Inc., to operate in Escambia County, Florida;
