B. Approve the Minutes of the Attorney-Client Session held September 10, 2026;
C. Accept, for filing with the Board's Minutes, the Report of the Gary Sansing Public Forum held September 10, 2026; and
D. Approve the Minutes of the Regular BCC Meeting held September 10, 2026.
